{
  "about": "Input checks and target rules (appendix A 15-17). Each case is what a user typed for a command kind (account, post, list, community, space) and either what it normalizes to or that it is refused before any request (exit 2) with the fix's subject. source says where the rule comes from: code (the previous skill's targets.py), plan (a decision of the rebuild plan), or P2 (an inference the live recon confirms). All handles and ids are synthetic.",
